erything that's gone on I do  I feel God's presence in it and I just  hope that we can both you know in in our  different paths encourage people and  help people and hopefully let others  know that they're not  not alone I go to sleep at night knowing  that I did give it my all today at 27  Bristol is putting her best foot forward  I'm thankful for the road that's got me  here and I'm thankful for you know the  mom that I'm becoming in the woman that  I'm becoming  [Music]
 

